      "detailed_description": "Stamp Boy is a retro style puzzle-platformer about a hero and his stomp ability on a quest for rescuing a princess from an evil monster. Defeat bosses to get closer and closer to her. Collect Orbs in every level to unlock secret stuff. No randomly generated levels! Everything is handcrafted!<br><br><strong>The Amazing Stomp Ability</strong> - The reliable Stomp Ability will keep you alive when fighting monsters!<br><br><strong>No Randomly Generated Levels</strong> - Beating each level is only up to your skill!<br><br>More than <strong>30 different levels and more than 4 horrific bosses</strong> waiting for you!<br><br>If You Like Pixel Art And Puzzle Platformer Games, If You're Tired Of Random Generation, Maybe You Will Like This! Hope You Will Enjoy It!",
      "about_the_game": "Stamp Boy is a retro style puzzle-platformer about a hero and his stomp ability on a quest for rescuing a princess from an evil monster. Defeat bosses to get closer and closer to her. Collect Orbs in every level to unlock secret stuff. No randomly generated levels! Everything is handcrafted!<br><br><strong>The Amazing Stomp Ability</strong> - The reliable Stomp Ability will keep you alive when fighting monsters!<br><br><strong>No Randomly Generated Levels</strong> - Beating each level is only up to your skill!<br><br>More than <strong>30 different levels and more than 4 horrific bosses</strong> waiting for you!<br><br>If You Like Pixel Art And Puzzle Platformer Games, If You're Tired Of Random Generation, Maybe You Will Like This! Hope You Will Enjoy It!",
      "short_description": "Stamp Boy is a retro style puzzle-platformer about a hero and his stomp ability on a quest for rescuing a princess from an evil monster. Defeat bosses to get closer and closer to her. Collect Orbs in every level to unlock secret stuff. No randomly generated levels! Everything is handcrafted!",
      "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
      "reviews": "“这是一款像素风格的平台跳跃游戏，游戏包含轻度的解谜元素，规则简单，玩法轻松有趣。一共包含30多个精心设计的关卡和4场BOSS战，游戏流程虽不长，但性价比极高。”<br>8/10 – 向日葵游戏<br><br>“A very short, but very fun throwback to games that were seen on the Game Boy Advance. A wonderful product by a first time developer. And for $2, it's more than worth the price!”<br>Ten's Indie Seeker<br><br>“Great but short pixel platformer. Had a lot of fun with this one.”<br>Indie Diamonds<br>",
